# Composite Sleeve for Dropout Fuse (硬化纤维复合玻纤套管（跌落式熔断器）)

**Document:** Engineering reference, P15, revision 2026-09  
**Product family:** Fuse & Arc Quenching  
**Manufacturer:** WELLELE (Well Electric)  
**Product page:** https://wellele.com/fuse-body-tube-power-protection/

